1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,320
Every payment you accept. Somebody else takes a cut.

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:06,179
Locked in. Rented. Never really yours.

3
00:00:06,199 --> 00:00:08,021
What if you owned the entire stack?

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,206
Meet OwnPay.

5
00:00:10,456 --> 00:00:13,957
The open-source payment orchestrator that you host yourself.

6
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:17,334
Your server. Your data. Your rules.

7
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:23,665
Run every brand, every gateway, and every transaction from one clean dashboard.

8
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:29,887
Create a payment link in seconds. Your customers get a fast, hosted checkout.

9
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:34,943
Connect the gateways you need through plugins. No vendor lock-in.

10
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:40,611
Follow every transaction, and understand your revenue with built-in reports.

11
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:46,356
Developers get scoped API keys, webhooks, and a clean API.

12
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:53,154
Role-based access, login security logs, and audit integrity checks keep you in control.

13
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:59,868
Make it yours with themes and branding. Pair a mobile device to catch payment SMS.

14
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:04,494
OwnPay. Open source. Self-hosted. Yours.

15
00:01:04,594 --> 00:01:08,576
Get it at ownpay.org, and star the project on GitHub.
